[{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0013","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-3206","title":"Seagate BlackArmor NAS 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Seagate BlackArmor NAS 存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 localhost/backupmgt/localJob.php 的 session 参数或 localhost/backupmgmt/pre_connect_check.php 的 auth_name 参数发送特制请求，触发任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Seagate BlackArmor NAS 系列设备，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，攻击者可完全控制受影响的 NAS 设备，窃取或破坏存储数据。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-3206"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-23T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:07:48Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Seagate BlackArmor NAS 设备，该产品已停止技术支持且官方未发布任何安全补丁。如无法立即替换，应在防火墙上限制对设备 80/443 端口的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并将设备置于独立 VLAN 中隔离，同时禁用 backupmgt 目录的 Web 访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/33159/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-3206.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-3206.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2014/CVE-2014-3206.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/edc652d6e05ef25aee5fb9d5d13e49f90fcfe6b7/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-3206.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-3206/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-3206.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-3206_2.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2014/CVE-2014-3206.yaml","https://github.com/ajay1706/testing/blob/8d7af24fb6723eadd8614fc81c1f764561b8bbc2/results/run-29260295305/nuclei-critical.txt","https://github.com/jivy26/infiltra/blob/ecdaa0908adf81aec0199fec3179af7351e2ede0/infiltra/nuclei-templates/config/recommended.yml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/other/z-11753_3.yaml","https://github.com/patrickmpalmer/exploit-prediction-calculator/blob/a048424e68e6b5ea7f4d32bf29dddd4eda342b01/data_gathering/data/exploited_cves.csv","https://github.com/laccart/CVE-2014-3206"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0004","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-1203","title":"Eyou Mail System 远程文件包含漏洞","description":"Eyou Mail System 3.6 之前版本中的 get_login_ip_config_file 函数存在命令注入漏洞，攻击者可通过向 admin/domain/ip_login_set/d_ip_login_get.php 文件的 domain 参数传递包含 shell 元字符的恶意 payload，在未经身份认证的情况下远程执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Eyou Mail System 全系列版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，建议用户立即升级至 3.6 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-1203"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-24T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:04:31Z","remediation":"升级 Eyou Mail System 至 3.6 及以上版本，该版本修复了 `domain` 参数过滤不严导致的命令注入问题。若无法立即升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Nginx/Apache）对 `/admin/domain/ip_login_set/d_ip_login_get.php` 路径添加访问控制，限制仅允许可信管理 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Jan/32","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1203.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-1203.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-1203.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2014/1xxx/CVE-2014-1203.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2014/CVE-2014-1203.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-1203.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-1203_17.yaml","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2014-1203.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/03/rceArtifact/rceReport.csv","https://github.com/Forsaken0129/notes/blob/f05fcc5421d05c4f0e9c7d03f7a50997782ef34f/resume-cliejsfkgq6taau7l6g0.cfg"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0015","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-3744","title":"Node.js st 模块目录遍历漏洞","description":"Node.js 生态中的 st 静态文件服务模块在 0.2.5 版本之前存在目录遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在请求路径中构造 %2e%2e（URL 编码的 ..）序列绕过路径限制，可读取目标服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、源代码等）。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 st 模块的 Node.js 应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2014-3744"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-23T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:08:49Z","remediation":"立即将 `st` 模块升级至 0.2.5 或以上版本（`npm install st@0.2.5`），该版本已修复路径遍历问题。如无法升级，可在应用层对请求路径中的 `%2e%2e`、`..` 等目录穿越序列进行过滤拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2014/05/13/1","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2014/05/15/2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/67389","https://github.com/isaacs/st","https://nodesecurity.io/advisories/st_directory_traversal","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-3744.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-3744.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/edc652d6e