7-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/133034/Netsweeper-Bypass-XSS-Redirection-SQL-Injection-Execution.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37933/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37933","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9618.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9618.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9618.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9618/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9618.py","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2014-9618-2451.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Netsweeper/CVE-2014-9618.yaml","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2014-9618.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2014-9618-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-9618_9.yaml","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9618.yaml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5efb5641cd6797d997be61005a4379e90a26bc5/2014/CVE-2014-9618.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0038","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-8676","title":"SOPlanning 路径遍历漏洞","description":"SOPlanning 1.32及更早版本中的file_get_contents函数存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过在URL路径参数中注入`..`（点点）序列，遍历服务器目录结构，判断任意文件是否存在。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤，导致攻击者可利用目录穿越技术访问Web根目录之外的文件系统。虽然该漏洞仅能确认文件存在性而无法直接读取文件内容，但可为后续攻击（如信息收集、漏洞定位）提供重要线索。影响所有运行SOPlanning 1.32及之前版本的系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2014-8676"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-08-31T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:08Z","remediation":"升级 SOPlanning 至 1.33 或更高版本（厂商已于 2014 年 9 月发布补丁）。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置规则，阻止对 `/process/feries.php` 的 `fichier` 参数包含 `..` 路径遍历字符的请求，或在 PHP 配置中禁用 `allow_url_fopen` 并关闭 `display_errors` 以防止错误信息泄露文件路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132654/Simple-Online-Planning-Tool-1.3.2-XSS-SQL-Injection-Traversal.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2015/Jul/44","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75726","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37604/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8676.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-8676.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8676.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/8xxx/CVE-2014-8676.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-8676_2.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-8676","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2014/CVE-2014-8676.json","https://github.com/s7ck-Team/exploit-db/blob/d8beff1b244df756db7e2c1b2dccad9778328ea1/files/SO%20Planning%201.32%20-%20Multiple%20Vulnerabilities.txt","https://github.com/SentinelXofficial/sxel-templates/blob/81a207f6b6484ddb155de7ef8ecdcd8078a36dbe/cves/2014/CVE-2014-8676.yaml","https://github.com/d3ndr1t30x/retrodb/blob/1a6f4d2ca506edd50fa3ab031ae4f299bc6538fb/exploitdb/exploits/php/webapps/37604.txt","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-8676_33.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0222","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-3931","title":"MRLG Multi-Router Looking Glass fastping.c 远程内存破坏漏洞","description":"MRLG（Multi-Router Looking Glass）5.5.0 之前版本中的 fastping.c 存在内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的 ICMP 数据包触发任意内存写入，导致服务崩溃或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行 MRLG 5.5.0 以下版本的服务器，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至 MRLG 5.5.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-3931"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-03-31T16:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:09:09Z","remediation":"升级 MRLG 至 5.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 fastping.c 中的内存写入缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界限制对 MRLG 服务的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的 ICMP 功能以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mrlg.op-sec.us/","http://www.s3.eurecom.fr/cve/CVE-2014-3931.txt","https://hackerone.com/reports/16330","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-3931","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-3931.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2014/3xxx/CVE-2014-3931.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-3931","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2014/3xxx/CVE-2014-3931.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-3931/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-3931.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-3931.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2014/CVE-2014-3931.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-vwmm-77c8-pxrj/GHSA-vwmm-77c8-pxrj.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2014-3931.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0056","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9735","title":"ThemePunch Slider Revolution WordPress插件任意文件上传执行漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 ThemePunch Slider Revolution（revslider）插件 3.0.96 之前版本及 Showbiz Pro 插件 1.7.1 及更早版本未正确限制管理员 AJAX 功能的访问权限，导致远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 update_plugin 操作上传并执行任意恶意文件，或通过 delete_slider 操作删除任意滑块，亦可创建、更新、导入、导出任意滑块数据。该漏洞影响大量使用该插件的 WordPress 站点，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可完全控制目标服务器，危害严重。公开的 Metasploit 模块和 Nuclei 模板可自动化利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9735"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-06-30T14:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:53Z","remediation":"立即将 ThemePunch Slider Revolution 插件升级到 3.0.96 或更高版本，同时将 Showbiz Pro 插件升级到 1.7.1 以上。如无法升级，可删除插件中 /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 对未授权用户的访问，或在 Web 服务器层面限制 /wp-content/plugins/revslider/ 目录的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Nov/78","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/71306","http://www.themepunch.com/products/old-revolution-slider-pre-4-2-vulnerabilty-explained/","https://blog.sucuri.net/2014/12/revslider-vulnerability-leads-to-massive-wordpress-soaksoak-compromise.html","https://plugins.trac.wordpress.org/browser/patch-for-revolution-slider/trunk/revsliderpatch.php","https://whatisgon.wordpress.com/2014/11/30/another-revslider-vulnerability/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/7954","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36957","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9735.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9735.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9735.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9735.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-9735","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-9735.rules","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-9735_1.yaml","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-9735_3.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-9735-8b6ec2d8d63b532d6dd0739418934d87.yaml","https://github.com/0x0pointer/skills/blob/cc55482cc53512e6353dee401e81bc081cd311d2/web/web-exploit/refs/cms-cves.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0056.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0056.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0508","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-8361","title":"Realtek rtl81xx miniigd SOAP 服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Realtek SDK 中的 miniigd UPnP SOAP 服务存在远程代码执行漏洞。该服务在处理 SOAP 请求时未对 `NewInternalClient` 请求进行充分验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 SOAP 请求触发任意代码执行。该漏洞广泛影响采用 Realtek RTL81xx 芯片组的路由器及物联网设备，攻击者仅需向目标设备的 UPnP 端口（通常 49152 及以上随机端口）发送恶意请求即可无需身份验证实现远程利用，CISA 将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。CVSS v3.1 评分为 9.8，属于严重级别，危害极大且利用门槛极低。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-8361"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-05-01T15:59:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:16:37Z","remediation":"升级到已打补丁的固件版本：D-Link 设备（DIR-615 升级至 6.07b01 或更高版本，DIR-600L 升级至 2.06b07 或更高版本，DIR-605L 升级至 3.04b02 或更高版本），ELECOM 产品（WRC-300FEBK/F300NF）请参照 https://www.elecom.co.jp/support/ 获取最新固件。如厂商未发布补丁，应立即禁用设备上的 UPnP（Universal Plug and Play）功能，消除 miniigd SOAP 服务的暴露面。如无法通过配置缓解，建议下线受影响设备并更换为其他厂商产品。同时在网络边界部署防火墙规则，禁止外部网络访问 miniigd SOAP 服务的 1900/UDP 端口，仅允许受信任的内网客户端访问该服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN47580234/index.html","http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN67456944/index.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/132090/Realtek-SDK-Miniigd-UPnP-SOAP-Command-Execution.html","http://securityadvisories.dlink.com/security/publication.aspx?name=SAP10055","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74330","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-15-155/","https://sensorstechforum.com/hinatabot-cve-2014-8361-ddos/","https://web.archive.org/web/20150909230440/http://securityadvisories.dlink.com/security/publication.aspx?name=SAP10055","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37169/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-8361","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37169","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-8361.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/26de5061583114da39b169a50d62374182961c7a/Lists/Others