l 参数中的 dot-dot 序列（如 `\\.\\.` 正则匹配）；(4) 鉴于项目已无人维护，建议迁移至仍在活跃开发的替代相册系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/show/osvdb/102204","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30865","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/90582","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/30865","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-10037.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-10037.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-10037.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-10037/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-10037.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2014-10037-2293.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2014-10037.yaml","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/26/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-10037-2294.yaml","https://github.com/emadshanab/nucleiDB/blob/a06eb8edf2853662c304e3f41f8887b65f56e399/cve-2014-10037-2295.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2014/10xxx/CVE-2014-10037.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0111","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-100005","title":"D-Link DIR-600 路由器跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"D-Link DIR-600 路由器 rev. Bx 版本在固件 2.17b02 之前存在多处跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞。远程攻击者可利用特制的配置模块向 hedwig.cgi 发送请求，劫持管理员会话创建管理员账户或启用远程管理功能；也可通过 SETCFG,SAVE,ACTIVATE 操作向 pigwidgeon.cgi 发送请求激活恶意配置，或通过 diagnostic.php 的 ping 操作发起攻击。攻击者需与目标设备处于同一局域网，且管理员已登录管理后台。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.0，危害等级高，可能导致设备完全受控。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-100005"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-01-13T11:59:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:04:00Z","remediation":"将 D-Link DIR-600 路由器固件升级至 2.17b02 或更高版本。如无法升级，在路由器管理界面禁用远程管理功能，并限制仅内网 IP 可访问管理页面（192.168.x.x），同时修改默认管理员密码为强密码。建议在 WAN 侧关闭 HTTP/HTTPS 管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://resources.infosecinstitute.com/csrf-unauthorized-remote-admin-access/","http://secunia.com/advisories/57304","http://securityadvisories.dlink.com/security/publication.aspx?name=SAP10018","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/91794","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-100005","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-100005.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2014/100xxx/CVE-2014-100005.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-100005","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-100005.rules","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2014/CVE-2014-100005/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-100005.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-100005.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/SSVC/data/2014/CVE-2014-100005.json","https://github.com/jacobdjwilson/awesome-annual-security-reports/blob/555c3697068336ba1316a2e07e39940daa01113a/Markdown%20Conversions/2024/Forescout-Threat-Review-2024.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2014/POC-AVE-2014-0111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2014/EXP-AVE-2014-0111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0002","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-100004","title":"Sitecore CMS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Sitecore CMS 7.0 Update-4之前版本存在跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向默认URI的xmlcontrol参数注入恶意Web脚本或HTML代码触发该漏洞，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户访问特制链接即可利用。该漏洞影响Sitecore CMS 7.0 Update-4之前所有版本，CVSS评分4.3，危害等级中危。建议升级至7.0 Update-4或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2014-100004"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-01-13T11:59:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:04:00Z","remediation":"升级 Sitecore CMS 至 7.0 Update-4 (rev. 140120) 或更高版本，该版本修复了 xmlcontrol 参数未正确过滤导致的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 中添加规则过滤 xmlcontrol 参数中的恶意脚本字符作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/102660","http://secunia.com/advisories/56705","http://sitecorekh.blogspot.dk/2014/01/sitecore-releases-70-update-4-rev-140120.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/530901/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/65254","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/90833","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-100004.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-100004.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2014/100xxx/CVE-2014-100004.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-100004","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-100004.rules","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2014/CVE-2014-100004.poc","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2014/CVE-2014-100004.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--67ccc313-ba0f-4f4c-a892-9337bfc802f6.json","https://github.com/SentinelXofficial/sxel-templates/blob/81a207f6b6484ddb155de7ef8ecdcd8078a36dbe/cves/2014/CVE-2014-100004.yaml","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/c2a438961cf6a6c47831738d9c79cfc3110107fc/data/lists/NucleiList.txt","https://github.com/thompson005/nuclei-scanner/blob/6b5cfd844640c882a3d278f76f395a74ee14ef81/nucleivault/pro%20template/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-100004.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0046","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9444","title":"WordPress Frontend Uploader 插件 0.9.2 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Frontend Uploader 插件 0.9.2 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向默认 URI 的 `errors[fu-disallowed-mime-type][0][name]` 参数中注入恶意的 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞影响 Frontend Uploader 0.9.2 及可能更早版本，攻击复杂度较低，但需要用户交互触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9444"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-01-02T20:59:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:18:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 Frontend Uploader 插件至最新版本（≥0.9.3），或直接停用并删除该插件。如无法升级，在 WordPress 后台 → 插件 → 编辑器中找到 frontend-uploader.php，对 `$_GET['errors']` 和 `$_POST` 参数添加 `esc_html()` 或 `htmlspecialchars()` 转义处理，防止恶意脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/129749/WordPress-Frontend-Uploader-0.9.2-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2014/Dec/122","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/71808","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9444.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9444.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9444.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2014/CVE-2014-9444/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2014-9444.py","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2014/CVE-2014-9444-frontend_uploader-5a0974a5-cfed-4d4d-ae91-f74d9cd531e7.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-9444_4.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/14d36cd646300e9b9b8fa1a2222524533239a69b/data/cve-2014-9444-2423.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2014-9444-2427.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2014-9444_7.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-9444_50.yaml","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2014-9444-2425.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0043","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9119","title":"WordPress DB Backup插件 目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress DB Backup 插件 4.5 及更早版本中的 download.php 文件存在目录遍历漏洞。由于程序未对 file 参数中的路径进行有效过滤，远程攻击者可通过在 file 参数中注入 ../ 等目录跳转序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件，如 wp-config.php 等敏感配置文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。建议用户立即升级插件至最新版本或移除该插件以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9119"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-12-31T22:59:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:47Z","remediation":"立即将 DB Backup 插件升级至 5.0 或更高版本（当前最新为 6.0），该版本已修复 download.php 中 file 参数未过滤路径遍历序列的问题。如无法升级，可删除插件目录中的 download.php 文件，或在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）层面添加规则拦截包含 `../` 的请求路径，同时限制 `/wp-content/plugins/db-backup/` 目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q4/1059","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/99368","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/7726","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35378","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9119.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2014/CVE-2014-9119.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9119.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9119.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2014/CVE-2014-9119.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2014-9119-915150a5b14cd5144e45c9339fa136e2.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2014-9119_2.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2014/CVE-2014-9119.json","https://github.com/wpsec/ARL-Source-Install/blob/aecf83f1f55a6f1a1a67dbe25e22ea0eb5a44bf2/tools/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2014/CVE-2014-9119.yaml","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2014/CVE-2014-9119-db_backup-faaade72-35d9-4597-812b-758fa2641472.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9119.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0520","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9163","title":"Adobe Flash Player 栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Adobe Flash Player 存在栈溢出缓冲区漏洞。由于在处理特制数据时未对输入长度进行充分边界验证，攻击者可通过构造恶意 Flash 内容（如 SWF 文件或嵌入 Flash 的网页）触发栈溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 macOS 平台上的 Flash Player 13.0.0.259 之前版本、14.x 及 15.0.0.246 之前版本，以及 Linux 平台上的 11.2.202.425 之前版本。攻击者需要诱使用户使用受影响版本的 Flash Player 打开恶意网页或文件，利用过程无需身份认证。该漏洞已于 2014 年 12 月被发现在野利用，Adobe 随后发布安全更新修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9163"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2014-12-10T21:59:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:51Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至修复版本：Windows 与 OS X 平台升级至 13.0.0.260 或 15.0.0.246 及以上版本，Linux 平台升级至 11.2.202.425。如暂时无法升级，应在所有浏览器中彻底禁用 Flash 插件，并清理浏览器缓存中的 Flash 内容；鉴于 Adobe Flash Player 已停止生命周期支持，建议寻求替代方案或直接卸载该产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb14-27.html","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2014-9163","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2014/CVE-2014-9163.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/721f5647080ad234b0e7db49f4cb7a1a1f72d604/cves/2014/9xxx/CVE-2014-9163.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2014/CVE-2014-9163","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c1885e29a64bdc8eb40f14a6124c86d86a06263f/osv/cve/2014/UBUNTU-CVE-2014-9163.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2014-9163.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2014-9163.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/661818a489d196676957d469a0bf9cda171fbbe9/SSVC/data/2014/CVE-2014-9163.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2014-9163","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2014/CVE-2014-9163.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2014/AVE-2014-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2014-0045","file_name":"2014/AVE-2014-0045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2014-9180","title":"Eleanor CMS go.php 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Eleanor CMS 的 go.php 文件存在开放重定向漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 QUERY_STRING 参数传入恶意 URL，将用户重定向至任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户点击特制链接即可触发。影响 Eleanor CMS 所有受影响版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至最新版本或对 go.php 的重定向目标进行白名单校验。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2014-9180"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2014-12-02T16:59:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:17:52Z","remediation":"Eleanor CMS 官方已停止维护，建议立即在 go.php 中添加 URL 白名单验证机制：仅允许重定向到本站域名或预定义的信任域名列表，拒绝所有外部 URL 重定向。具体实现可在 go.php 中增加 parse_url() 解析 QUERY_STRING 参数，提取 host 部分与白名单比对，不匹配则返回 400 错误或跳转到首页。如无法修改代码，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面配置规则拦截对 go.php 的非本站域名参数传递。","status":"completed","collected_a